    <title>Alaska, Ferries, Haines, Skagway</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/alaska_ferries_haines_skagway</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;One of the things we expect to do as we get to Whitehorse, Yukon Territory, is to detour over to Alaska to see the Inside Passage. We hope to ride to Haines or Skagway and hop the ferry and take a ride of undetermined length to see those wonderful glaciers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Information resources include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mvermeulen.com/klondike/index.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Mike Vermeulen&#039;s ride&lt;/a&gt; on the Haines to Skagway loop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
