  <item>
    <title>In Inuvik, SOUTH on the Dempster!</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/in_inuvik_south_on_the_dempster</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;We made it to Inuvik and we&#039;re headed south on the Dempster Highway tomorrow morning! I&#039;d hoped to have a picture of Inuvik for you but the library is closing so I&#039;m rushing it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;480 miles to Dawson City. A store in Fort McPherson and the hotel at Eagle Plains are the only real things between here and there. It&#039;s almost all dirt, and of course we hear all the horror stories about it, like bears and mosquitoes and moose. I think we&#039;ll have a blast. We&#039;ll let you know in 10-14 days.  We&#039;re glad to have you along with us!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
     <category domain="https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/inuvik_to_ushuaia">Inuvik to Ushuaia</category>
